      "versionNonce": 291124681,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771763512844,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "研究的是物理层的载体（如何表示和传输波形）。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "研究的是物理层的载体（如何表示和传输波形）。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EWUaibJ2G_v-uZGQ4jj4R",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 740.187850996258,
      "y": 694.8764275450324,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 467888556,
      "version": 116,
      "versionNonce": 1040356521,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771763512844,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "研究的是抽象层的极限（理论上的最高效率和安全性）。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "研究的是抽象层的极限（理论上的最高效率和安全性）。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ONnpJUgUM6BYBpW9YcwCS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 740.4839563041076,
      "y": 643.9020539645071,
      "width": 607.97998046875,
      "height": 25,
